Confirmed: `xfs_vn_getattr` reads `XFS_ISIZE(ip)` locklessly at line 719 — no DLM coordination. The fix is to DLM-coordinate (e.g., `xfs_ilock(ip, XFS_ILOCK_SHARED)` to trigger the inode-DLM PR acquire) before reading attrs — but the reload is gated on `i_dlm_stale`, which is false here (the node holds an uncoordinated cached in-core inode), so the fix must *force* a FUA-reload regardless. This is a fresh-context implementation task. Let me record this final precision and wrap up (relay imminent):
